---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Apps and tools
description: Every Xerodonia app and tool for iPhone, iPad and Mac, with links to each one's privacy policy and support page.
---
{%- set cardHeading = "h2" %}{# the cards follow the h1 directly #}
<section class="section products" aria-labelledby="apps-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h1 id="apps-title" class="page-title">Apps and tools</h1>
      <p>Made with care in Sydney. No ads, no tracking, and nothing more than they need.</p>
    </header>
    <ul class="product-grid">
      {#- asyncEach, not for: the card uses the async image shortcode -#}
      {%- asyncEach app in apps | sortProducts %}
      {% include "partials/product-card.njk" %}
      {%- endeach %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
